    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Dice determine your steps, cards rewrite your rules \u2014</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the gamble with the Demon, luck is the stake, strategy the ace.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D pixel-art <strong>dice-driven strategy adventure</strong> blending mysterious Tarot card items, random event choices, and gambling showdowns, where the roll of dice writes the final chapter of the Demon's contract.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Dice as Destiny, Cards as Decree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Gambler,&quot; bound by a demonic contract, throws dice to selectively complete events, collect Tarot card items, and ultimately accumulate enough damage and resources in the <strong>Demon's Gamble</strong> to win freedom for their soul:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Dice-Driven Event Selection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is a high-stakes gamble: movement, combat, and transactions all depend on dice rolls.<br><strong>Event Chains &amp; Resource Games:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd36 Gold Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f Life Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Demon Damage Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Demon Attack Events</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Tarot Card Items: Aces to Rewrite Dice Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Tarot cards transform into key items, each capable of warping dice mechanics or event outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Demon's Gamble: The Ultimate Fate Duel</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stage Accumulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaken the Demon's HP through events, preserve your own life, stockpile gold, and acquire items while navigating the Demon's escalating rules across each floor's <strong>fifth stage</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gambling Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Ultimate duel\u00a0</strong>where massive damage can decide the outcome in an instant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HP is deducted alongside the Demon's, determining the final winner:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proceed to the next floor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your soul to eternal damnation</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Dice determine your steps, cards rewrite your rules \u2014</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the gamble with the Demon, luck is the stake, strategy the ace.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D pixel-art <strong>dice-driven strategy adventure</strong> blending mysterious Tarot card items, random event choices, and gambling showdowns, where the roll of dice writes the final chapter of the Demon's contract.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Dice as Destiny, Cards as Decree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Gambler,&quot; bound by a demonic contract, throws dice to selectively complete events, collect Tarot card items, and ultimately accumulate enough damage and resources in the <strong>Demon's Gamble</strong> to win freedom for their soul:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Dice-Driven Event Selection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is a high-stakes gamble: movement, combat, and transactions all depend on dice rolls.<br><strong>Event Chains &amp; Resource Games:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd36 Gold Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f Life Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Demon Damage Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Demon Attack Events</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Tarot Card Items: Aces to Rewrite Dice Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Tarot cards transform into key items, each capable of warping dice mechanics or event outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Demon's Gamble: The Ultimate Fate Duel</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stage Accumulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaken the Demon's HP through events, preserve your own life, stockpile gold, and acquire items while navigating the Demon's escalating rules across each floor's <strong>fifth stage</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gambling Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Ultimate duel\u00a0</strong>where massive damage can decide the outcome in an instant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HP is deducted alongside the Demon's, determining the final winner:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proceed to the next floor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your soul to eternal damnation</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
